{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n \n 私はハマりやすいし影響されやすいです。\n \n 今は自分のことをゴミだと思っている\n フォーキーが大好きです🥺🥺\n トイストーリー4、とってもお勧めです、、。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n 日曜日はパシフィコ横浜で\n 8th「黒い羊」最後の握手会でした！\n 欅坂46さんと一緒なのも最後で\n なんだか実感のないまま終わってしまいました、、。\n \n もう一緒にならないと思うと\n 悲しいです、、。\n \n でも沢山写真撮りました💗\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34HZTJESQH0HH689XZMYTZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n りささんの生誕祭で\n お花を渡す役割をいただきました！\n 本当に嬉しかったです💗\n でもとっても緊張しました😭\n \n 重要な役割をくださり、\n ありがとうございました！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J14JXKEA3YDMY1K5VRQY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J2411G0D8P54JKF90D1T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J34Y6XXTFB5YXH5XXVQ8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J43XFZXZBR2H0A8SJC8W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 花束を渡すと聞いた時のきくちゃんです。\n \n ①驚く\n ②喜ぶ\n ③喜びを噛み締めて泣く\n ④お礼をする\n \n 以上の流れです。\n お納めください。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J55JXBMRZ0KB12H52RCX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n もりねえと天ちゃん💗\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J64VYVJNBKQNDX01RGR6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J759TNCPF84HZB0QAM2Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J862M8FSFRMVZ1SA4VDD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 親戚の集まりみたいになりました（笑）\n \n 天ちゃんときくちゃんは\n 10歳離れていました😭😭😭\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34J94H0DE1JR67JDE5H5RR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\